# CODING — working alongside the user. Derived from base.pet `sit`.
#
# Laptop (code_type_*; meeting.pet meet_type_* should match):
#   lid back   rows 12-14, cols 2-11: row 12 k top edge, row 13 g, row 14 G, k sides
#   deck       row 15, cols 1-12: k ends, d fill
#   forearms   orange: row 10 cols 4-5 & 8-9, row 11 cols 3-5 & 8-10
#   paws       cream `ww` over the lid edge at row 12 cols 4-5 and 8-9;
#              a raised (typing) paw sits at row 11 and the edge under it returns to k
#   glow       `bb` on the lower chest, row 11 cols 6-7
#   eyes       looking down 1 px: rows 6-7 at cols 4 and 9
# Magnifier (code_search_*): 4x4 round ring `g` right of the head, cols 12-15,
#   2x2 lens (`z` glint top-left, `b`), `k` corners/top; `G` handle below-left; cream paw under the handle
#   with an orange arm in the gap between body and tail. Moves up 1 px on _2.
# Terminal (code_run): 6x6 window cols 0-5 rows 10-15, `k` frame, `G` title bar,
#   `d` screen with a green `t` prompt `>` and `_` cursor.
# Think (code_think_*): viewer-left paw to the jaw corner, cream (8,2)(9,1)(9,2), elbow out
#   orange (10,1)(10,2) with k outline; eyes up-right rows 4-5; z dots (4,13)(2,14)(0,15).
# Alert (code_alert): react.pet `alert` pose (whole fox 1 px up, legs extended; ear design unchanged)
#   plus a red `!` at col 14: rows 0-2 bar, row 4 dot (same glyph as events.pet notify).

